1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,400
九百年前，一位老画师用了一生，
Nine hundred years ago, an old painter spent his whole life

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,400
画了一幅很长很长的画——《万灵图》。
painting one very long scroll: The Painting of Ten Thousand Spirits.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,400
画里有一座小镇，叫青墨镇。
Inside it lies a little town called Qingmo.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,733
在青墨镇，被叫出名字的东西，才会活过来。
In Qingmo Town, only things that are called by name come alive.

5
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:17,067
墨先生是长卷的守护人，小砚是他的徒弟。
Mr. Mo guards the scroll; Xiao Yan is his apprentice.

6
00:00:17,167 --> 00:00:20,400
有一天，小砚滴下了一滴墨——它变成了团团。
One day she spilled a drop of ink... and it became Tuantuan.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,067
守在镇门口的，是大绒。
Guarding the town gate is Da Rong.

8
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:26,733
他说话很慢，睡觉很多，
He talks slowly and sleeps a lot,

9
00:00:26,833 --> 00:00:29,400
可谁也别想欺负青墨镇。
but nobody messes with Qingmo Town.

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,400
夜市里最吵的两位：开灯笼铺的阿灯，
The two loudest folks at the night market: A Deng of the lantern shop

11
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,400
和开当铺的呱掌柜。
and Shopkeeper Gua of the pawnshop.

12
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,400
他们天天吵架，也天天一起吃宵夜。
They argue every day, and eat late-night snacks together every day.

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,733
鹤翁是长卷里最老的一位，他见过画师本人。
Elder He is the oldest one in the scroll; he once met the painter himself.

14
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:47,067
而我，是鹿鸣——
And I am Lu Ming,

15
00:00:47,167 --> 00:00:50,400
一个走遍长卷、讲故事的人。
a storyteller who has walked the whole scroll.

16
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,400
可是最近，长卷开始褪色。
But lately, the scroll has begun to fade.

17
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,400
人们忘了一个字，画里就少一种颜色。
Each time people forget a word, the painting loses a color.

18
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,400
灰雾里，总有一个撑伞的人……
And in the grey mist, there is always someone with an umbrella...

19
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,400
没有人知道，他叫什么名字。
No one knows his name.

20
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:09,400
九个角色，一幅长卷，一个被忘记的名字。
Nine characters, one scroll, one forgotten name.

21
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:14,400
这一次，我们要把失落的字，一个一个找回来。
This time, we will find the lost words, one by one.

22
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:19,400
《墨灵记》——被记住的，就不会消失。
The Ink Spirits: what is remembered never fades.
